# Dockerfile uses explicit COPY paths for exactly what's needed, so this
# mainly matters for build-context upload speed and (critically) for
# never letting a local .env reach the image -- see Dockerfile's own
# note on why that matters for OPENAI_API_KEY.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git/
